    {
      "id": "PSA.52.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.52.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "To the chief Musician, Maschil, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "A Psalm",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " of David, when Doeg the Edomite came and told Saul, and said to him, David is come to the house of Ahimelech. Why boastest thou thyself in mischief, O mighty man? the goodness of God ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "endureth",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " continually.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.52.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.52.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thy tongue deviseth mischiefs; like a sharp razor, working deceitfully.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.52.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.52.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thou lovest evil more than good; ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " lying rather than to speak righteousness. Selah.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.52.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.52.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thou lovest all devouring words, O ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "thou",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " deceitful tongue.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.52.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.52.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "God shall likewise destroy thee for ever, he shall take thee away, and pluck thee out of ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "thy",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " dwelling-place, and root thee out of the land of the living. Selah.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.52.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.52.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The righteous also shall see, and fear, and shall laugh at him:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.52.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.52.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Lo, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "this is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the man ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "that",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " made not God his strength; but trusted in the abundance of his riches, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " strengthened himself in his wickedness.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.52.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.52.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But I ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "am",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " like a green olive tree in the house of God: I trust in the mercy of God for ever and ever.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.52.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.52.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I will praise thee for ever, because thou hast done ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ": and I will wait on thy name; for ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " good before thy saints.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
